---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy | Must-Have GitHub Apps"
  description="How this directory handles website analytics and coding-agent prompt data."
>
  <section class="container page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="display">Simple by default.</h1>
    <p>This site does not access your repositories or send your prompt text anywhere.</p>
  </section>
  <article class="container detail-content">
    <h2>Website analytics</h2>
    <p>
      When configured, this site uses Umami for aggregate website traffic such as page views and
      broad trends. It does not receive repository context or generated prompts.
    </p>
    <h2>Agent prompts</h2>
    <p>
      The prompt builder runs in your browser. Your project name, branch, notes, and generated
      prompt are not uploaded, stored, or placed in the URL.
    </p>
    <h2>What you should not paste</h2>
    <p>
      Never paste passwords, API keys, tokens, private keys, customer data, or other sensitive
      information into a prompt.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about this project, use the <a
        href="https://github.com/jordan-thirkle/must-have-github-apps/issues"
        >public repository issues</a
      >.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
